<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Boston Beer cut, stock off.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Boston Beer cut, stock off.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it cut its rating on Boston Beer Co Inc to a neutral from its prior rating of buy on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares were indicated sharply lower, at 12-1/2 to 14-1/2, according to the New York Stock Exchange.  They closed at 16 on Tuesday.</p>
